   1181  f1fd							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1182  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1183  f1fd							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1184  f1fd							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1185  f1fd							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
