   1638  f437							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1639  f437							; UE_Tentacle — chase RoomX: 1 px toward the player every 4th frame, gated by
   1640  f437							; a wall probe. Probe reuses PlayerHitsMap via RoomX/RoomY swap (plan spec):
   1641  f437							; save player xy in ActiveObjectX/Y scratch (NOT the stack — 3 pha drove SP to
   1642  f437							; $F4 and jsr return bytes stomped BombTimer $F7 / BombX $F6 every 4th frame,
   1643  f437							; so the fuse never reached 0), put candidate X + live tentacle Y, call,
   1644  f437							; restore from scratch (lda/sta do not disturb C), commit only when C=0.
   1645  f437							; Slot X likewise saved in EnemyIndex (PHM clobbers X in its rect walk
   1646  f437							; — E3 gate bug: the commit wrote to EnemyRamX[row] instead of
   1647  f437							; EnemyRamX[slot] → frozen X). All three bytes are write-before-read for
   1648  f437							; every reader (SelectActiveObject/CheckEnemyHit rewrite before reading).
   1649  f437							; Candidate >= 160 (incl. wrap 255) rejected before probe — room edge hold.
   1650  f437							; In: X = enemy slot. Clobbers A/Y/Temp/X (X restored around the probe).
   1651  f437							; Entered via JMP from the dispatch; every path exits .TentOut → jmp UE_Next.
   1652  f437							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
