   3958  fe90							; ObjColorTab — per-scanline GRP1 object colors, stride 8 = ObjSprites
   3959  fe90							; stride; indexed by the same X = ObjBase + r in .Grp1 at $FE00 (4c, same
   3960  fe90							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
   3961  fe90							; per OBJ_* slot: type color x8 (matches EnemyColorTable /
   3962  fe90							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   3963  fe90							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
   3964  fe90							; NOTE: dark rooms no longer force grey objects — the frame-level $0A write
   3965  fe90							; is overridden per row (no budget for a dark skip flag; see .Line probe).
   3966  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
