   4296  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4297  ffe6							; TallyTramp ($FFE6, byte-identical with BANK1 now — the body moved there in
   4298  ffe6							; repack chunk 3, 2026-10-20; guard: verify_build). bank0 jsr's here
   4299  ffe6							; (CheckMinerPickup arm / TallyWork step): `sta $1FF7` selects bank1, then the
   4300  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   4301  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   4302  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
   4303  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4304  ffe6		       f4 4f	   TallyEntry =	$F44F	; bank1 TallyEntry — operand must match label
   4305  ffe6				   TallyTramp
   4306  ffe6		       8d f7 1f 	      sta	$1FF7
   4307  ffe9		       4c 4f f4 	      jmp	TallyEntry
