   4309  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4310  ffec							; HotOverlapFlag — bank3 entry tramp (C7 2026-10-20: the hot walk went back
   4311  ffec							; to bank3 with the shape/extras stream it reads). Moved off $FE90 into the
   4312  ffec							; 6-byte gap after TallyTramp. bank0 executes `sta $1FF9`; the `jmp` at +3 is
   4313  ffec							; fetched from bank3's image at $FFEF (guard: check_moth_tramp).
   4314  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4315  ffec					      .ds	$FFEC - *, 0
